:: StoryTitle
Duplex Example

:: StoryInit
<<set $passageMode = "append">>
<<set $visits = 0>>

:: Start
This story is currently in **$passageMode** mode.

[[Walk into the woods->Woods]]

:: Woods
<<set $visits = $visits + 1>>
You have entered the woods $visits time(s).

<<if $visits is 1>>The trail is still unfamiliar.<<else>>You recognize the trail now.<</if>>

[[Visit the stream->Stream]]

<<switch $visits>>
<<case 1>>A single nighthawk calls overhead.
<<case 2 3>>Two nighthawks circle above the trail.
<<default>>The night is crowded with wings.
<</switch>>

:: Stream
Water passes over silver stones.

[[Return to the woods->Woods]]
